+// DOS-PORT (patch 0149, Phase 11 wave-53 lever 3 -- MODEX sec.5.7):
+// skip-redundant-clearScreen lever. map_clear_is_redundant() returns
+// true when the backdrop pass will provably repaint every screen row
+// this frame, so DrawScene's full-screen clearScreen(BLACK) is
